{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1221728-szoreny-x-the-ebon-dragon-to-ship-or-not-to-ship","id":1221728,"title":"Szoreny x The Ebon Dragon, to ship or not to ship?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-05-24T09:13:18-07:00","id":1221728,"title":"Szoreny x The Ebon Dragon, to ship or not to ship?","content":"<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sTCSenE.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div> <br /> <br /> So, The Ebon Dragon is the shadows of everything that has ever lived, and as you all know, shadow mimic its &quot;owner&quot; movement (and general body shape), Szoreny, meanwhile, has themes of mirror and reflection which also mimics people movement (and appearance).<br /> <br /> Now I kinda wonder, if you are creating homebrew, demon for example, that draw on this particular theme of mimicry, how do you make an ED's mimic demon different from a Szoreny's mimic demon. Or do you think that TED should just leave the whole copying schtick to Szoreny and focus more on Occult and Lore? Game of Divinity did say that he has acquired forbidden secrets from hidden springs after all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":298,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","user":"Jen","date":". 05-25-2018, 01:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T09:41:39-07:00","id":1221736,"title":"","content":"Hm...as someone who's Infernal Homebrew has lead him to start shipping Yozis, this is a pairing I didn't think of (Elloge+ Oramous, Qaf+Cecelyne, Malfeas+SHLIHN, ED+Adjoran(less so in 3e than 2e), Kimbery+Hegera)...but works.<br /> I'd say if you want to do ED mimic charms, they're going to be diffrent in that ED is intreasted not so much in distortion as in doom. Szorney's woods is kinda like a weird fun house mirror, and he mimics in a straight up nemesis way.<br /> If you wantd a demon, I'd also pick a 2nd/3rd circle to draw from more than a direct Yozi. But! Drawing from Yozi's anyway!<br /> <br /> ED's themes of doom and despair and tragedy imply (to me) a mimic that causes despair in it's veiwer.&quot;This is what you could have been&quot;. Alternatively, a mimic that takes the form of losses from a persons life that are particularly poignant (or, as a cheap shot, a mimc that takes the form of a loved one, only to crumble away before the viewrs eyes. Yes, like the ghost baby from Rick and Morty).<br /> <br /> Szorny wants to <i>challenge you.</i>I'd say his reflections 1) are more likely to actually have your memories than EDs, 2) More...well, manipulative. Vindicitave. and 3) more likely to say somthing along the lines of &quot;you but better&quot; given Szorney changes his the reflections himself. I might suggest Mad Jack as an exampl, or other &quot;evil twin&quot; things.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T10:32:05-07:00","id":1221753,"title":"","content":"I would actually think that something that interprets shadows in terms of mimicry is valid as a soul of the Ebon Dragon even if that Yozi does not have such a focus itself. After all, Adorjan doesn't really have anything to do with roads, or She Who Lives in Her Name with the earth.<br /> <br /> As for a difference...<br /> <br /> \u200bI can see a Third Circle Demon coming from Szoreny that goes for the copying and inversion thing, whereas a soul of the Ebon Dragon... I'm thinking of something that might more literally capture the idea of a shadow... something to do with negative space, with a shape cast by obscuring. Maybe something like a demon that doesn't become a version of the person facing it, so much as a kind of personification of what such a person distracts from or denies or undermines.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T10:54:16-07:00","id":1221763,"title":"","content":"Not to mention a shadow is more of a moving outline with little to no detail than a true copy, mirror inverted or otherwise.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T10:59:28-07:00","id":1221766,"title":"","content":"I think that a distinction could be that Ebon Dragon draws more on subtle diferences and Szoreny has more equal or complete opposite vibe.<br /> <br /> An Ebon Shadow mimicry is one of slight differences and contrasts.<br /> <br /> A Szoreny mimicry is perfect or inverted.<br /> <br /> I dunno, just tripping.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2746-tgueiros","name":"TGUEIROS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2746_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T12:46:45-07:00","id":1221803,"title":"","content":"The way I see it, shadows mimic things by being what they are not, while reflections do so by being what they are, but opposite. You could predict what your reflection would be- it is who you are, but inverted. The same base qualities, but going to different directions- for example, if you are a compassionate person, your reflection would be just as compassionate- but where you would save the life of someone in need, your reflection would kill them in order to put them out of their misery. Shadows, however, are always defined by not being you- by being what you lack. The shadow of a compassionate person would be cruel and manipulative, yet similar just enough to make you doubt yourself, to think &quot;am I really my shadow? If it can do such terrible things, could I do the same? Do I really trust who I think I am?&quot;. You can't predict what your shadow would be- it is always bigger or smaller or distorted in some way- and it would haunt you and make you question yourself. Reflections don't do it. Sure, imperfect reflections do exist- but Szorney is a perfect mirror, and its surfaces would always tell the truth. He shows you who you really are, and who you could be, without judgement, without care. The Ebon Dragon would lie to you in order to drive you mad and make you fall to the pits of despair, turning you into your own shadow- but Szorney says only the truth, in the coldest, most objective way there is.<br /> <br /> At least, that's how I see it.<br /> <br /> Also- that's a truly creepy image up there! Very inspiring <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T13:23:49-07:00","id":1221821,"title":"","content":"Shipping is an interesting habit. On one hand, even unconventional pairings can lead to new avenues, wonderful storylines, and interesting new approaches to relationships. Shipping also reveals potential synergies which have proven.... useful, especially in construction of Infernal Exalted.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#800000\">However, as a former adherent to Szoreny's more recognized compatriot, I cannot fully endorse this particular pairing.</span></b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">That being said, that is a very fascinating portrait, and so I'll content myself to simply watch and see where this goes.</span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I used to know things. Forbidden things.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/306-brasstreader","name":"Brasstreader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar306_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T14:21:13-07:00","id":1221837,"title":"","content":"In terms of distinct themes<br /> <br /> Shadows evoke secret truths, buried pasts, and looming dooms.<br /> <br /> Reflections evoke inversions and equal balance, as well as distortion and gateways.<br /> <br /> Notably Black Mirror Shintai\u2019s effects from 2E will be a Szoreny flavored charm in 3E.<br /> <br /> <br /> As to shipping them, Isidoros would never tolerate it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 05-25-2018, 02:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T17:29:24-07:00","id":1221888,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1221728-szoreny-x-the-ebon-dragon-to-ship-or-not-to-ship?p=1221837#post1221837\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In terms of distinct themes<br /> <br /> Shadows invoke secret truths, buried pasts, and looming dooms.<br /> <br /> Reflections invoke inversions and equal balance, as well as distortion and gateways.<br /> <br /> Notably Black Mirror Shintai\u2019s effects from 2E will be a Szoreny flavored charm in 3E.</div> </div> </div> </div>Heartily approving of this - in fact the more i think of it, the more i'm tempted to take out Black Mirror Shintai and its branches from the ED's tree, to develop something else for its themes.<br /> <br /> I guess i might try something more geared on the idea of shadows as not duplicates, but outlines, observers and passive followers, the familiar but not quite safe presence/companion always beside you, the lurker/stalker entwined with our darker selves but always in plain view though mostly ignored and unseen.<br /> <br /> A little of the Neomah's communication through movement &amp; body language and sometimes passive or furtive elements of its shapechanging might go with that too. Something to jumpstart ideas at least. Hmmm, time to go to the drawing board.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 05-24-2018, 08:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T18:02:03-07:00","id":1221893,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1221728-szoreny-x-the-ebon-dragon-to-ship-or-not-to-ship?p=1221888#post1221888\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> A little of the Neomah's communication through movement &amp; body language and sometimes passive or furtive elements of its shapechanging might go with that too. Something to jumpstart ideas at least. Hmmm, time to go to the drawing board.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why Neomah for the Ebon Dragon? They're the progeny of Berengiere, Indulgent Soul of Ligier, Fetich of Malfeas.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T18:09:12-07:00","id":1221894,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1221728-szoreny-x-the-ebon-dragon-to-ship-or-not-to-ship?p=1221893#post1221893\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Why Neomah for the Ebon Dragon? They're the progeny of Berengiere, Indulgent Soul of Ligier, Fetich of Malfeas.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think its because Neomah communicate w/body language, in the same way a shadow would. Or an analogous way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T18:37:52-07:00","id":1221904,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epee102</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1221728-szoreny-x-the-ebon-dragon-to-ship-or-not-to-ship?p=1221894#post1221894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think its because Neomah communicate w/body language, in the same way a shadow would. Or an analogous way.</div> </div> </div> </div>Exactly that, also the &quot;adjusting the form to suit the target&quot; basic element of their shapeshifting, that could go well with a shadow theme, imho.<br /> I'm looking for themes and analogies that might help me with taking the ED's charmset in somewhat different but thematic directions and not really caring about specific hierarchies per se.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 05-24-2018, 09:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T18:51:30-07:00","id":1221907,"title":"","content":"This thread is pleasing to the Ebon Dragon. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> (What? <i>Someone</i> had to say it.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T19:13:30-07:00","id":1221913,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1221728-szoreny-x-the-ebon-dragon-to-ship-or-not-to-ship?p=1221907#post1221907\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This thread is pleasing to the Ebon Dragon. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> (What? <i>Someone</i> had to say it.)</div> </div> </div> </div> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=428\" data-tempid=\"temp_428_1527214320401_161\" /><br /> To be fair, though, I think Jen's going for more of a 1e, Yin sorta look.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I used to know things. Forbidden things.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/306-brasstreader","name":"Brasstreader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar306_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T19:23:53-07:00","id":1221915,"title":"","content":"I would be interested in Jen's take on all the Yozi, with this and the earlier image of Malfeas giving birth to UCS.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T19:38:04-07:00","id":1221916,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epee102</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1221728-szoreny-x-the-ebon-dragon-to-ship-or-not-to-ship?p=1221915#post1221915\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would be interested in Jen's take on all the Yozi, with this and the earlier image of Malfeas giving birth to UCS.</div> </div> </div> </div><u><span style=\"color:#000120\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/832588-the-yozi-and-hell-why-so-popular\">That</a></span></u><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/832588-the-yozi-and-hell-why-so-popular\"> already happened.</a><br /> <br /> \u200bAlthough I see now that it happened several months before you joined the forum.<br /> <br /> \u200bIncidentally, for anybody who wants to look back over every Jen thread started off with a jaunty art piece, just go to his profile, click on &quot;About&quot;, and at the bottom of the page there will be a link with which one can find every topic that he's started. They don't <i>all</i> start with a picture, but it's surely the easiest way to find all of the ones that do.<br /> <br /> \u200b(I hope it was worthwhile to make this comment, because somehow trying to look for an old thread messed up this tab of my browser. It was thankfully not a very long one and contained an easily recalled backlog, so it's not a total disaster as it would be for some other tabs, but those back pages were <b>mine</b>, and it rankles fiercely to lose them.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":158,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","user":"Isator Levi","date":". 05-24-2018, 10:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T20:12:36-07:00","id":1221925,"title":"","content":"...this is one of the Sixteen Forbidden Ships, detailed in sacred scrolls bound with unbreakable sapphire locks whose keys are held by the Maiden of Serenity. These relationships are so threatening to the fabric of history that they must be sealed away outside of Time. The Joybringers are dispatched to steal the thoughts of those who would write poems on these forbidden subjects, and to prevent the births of those who might otherwise be destined to launch such a ship. If any of the Forbidden Ships were to leave the realm of fiction and enter into reality, the resulting devastation would be cataclysmic.<br /> <br /> Szoreny, the Silver Forest, inverted though he may be, is a tree of worlds. His limbs branch outward and outward to infinity, endless variations of mimicry depicting every possible version. To move Szoreny is to move yourself. To love Szoreny is to no longer need Szoreny: for in loving Szoreny, you must look upon every version of yourself and learn, through the Silver Forest, to love yourself in all your splendid varieties.<br /> <br /> The Ebon Dragon is the Shadow of All Things, the darkness cast by the world's imperfections as they stand before the Light. The inventor of colors and the darkness that hides them from sight, a traitor even to himself, a coward who journeys where others dare not tread, he is a complex creature filled with myriad contradictions, and not least of these is that he loves only doomed things. Were the Shadow of All Things to love the Silver Forest, he would come to love himself...and in so doing, he would be doomed.<br /> <br /> And, my sorcerously inclined friends tell me, we very much need for things to have shadows.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T20:15:22-07:00","id":1221926,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1221728-szoreny-x-the-ebon-dragon-to-ship-or-not-to-ship?p=1221916#post1221916\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <u><span style=\"color:#000120\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/832588-the-yozi-and-hell-why-so-popular\">That</a></span></u><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/832588-the-yozi-and-hell-why-so-popular\"> already happened.</a><br /> <br /> \u200bAlthough I see now that it happened several months before you joined the forum.<br /> <br /> \u200bIncidentally, for anybody who wants to look back over every Jen thread started off with a jaunty art piece, just go to his profile, click on &quot;About&quot;, and at the bottom of the page there will be a link with which one can find every topic that he's started. They don't <i>all</i> start with a picture, but it's surely the easiest way to find all of the ones that do.<br /> <br /> \u200b(I hope it was worthwhile to make this comment, because somehow trying to look for an old thread messed up this tab of my browser. It was thankfully not a very long one and contained an easily recalled backlog, so it's not a total disaster as it would be for some other tabs, but those back pages were <b>mine</b>, and it rankles fiercely to lose them.)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> While I greatly enjoy those visuals, I meant in the full body mode.<br /> ...also the nit pickr in me wants to point out 1 Yozi is still missing, but that's her scthick so.. :P<br /> Still, thank you very much!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T21:12:20-07:00","id":1221935,"title":"","content":"I'm just here to say that art is amazeballs","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-25T01:46:36-07:00","id":1221966,"title":"","content":"I would argue that Szory and ED is more of an anti-ship<br /> <br /> A reflection needs light to work<br /> <br /> A shadow also needs light to work<br /> <br /> but you cannot get a reflection of a shadow - and a reflection does not cast a shadow<br /> <br /> the two probably don't like each other that way around, perhaps they see each other as rivals","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-25T03:46:59-07:00","id":1221978,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>webkilla</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1221728-szoreny-x-the-ebon-dragon-to-ship-or-not-to-ship?p=1221966#post1221966\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u2026you cannot get a reflection of a shadow\u2026</div> </div> </div> </div>I call foul on this one; the human eye only <i>works</i> because it reflects light. If it were impossible to &quot;get a reflection of a shadow,&quot; <i>we would be unable to see shadows</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 05-25-2018, 06:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-25T04:19:50-07:00","id":1221982,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1221728-szoreny-x-the-ebon-dragon-to-ship-or-not-to-ship?p=1221978#post1221978\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">the human eye only <i>works</i> because it reflects light.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well... sure, technically everything but a perfect black body reflects light to some extent, but the functioning of eyes is based on the absorption of light by the retinas, that are focused onto it by our eye lens, and enters through the pupil. Indeed, considering the fact that we perceive pupils to be black, even though they're an actual hole in the surface of our eyes... oh wait, are you saying that eyes only function because the <i>surface</i> of them is opaque, with only the pupil as the part that is permeable to light so that our perception of images can be focused?<br /> <br /> \u200b(If it wasn't the point, I'll continue to state that the black pupil indicates that the retina behind it is actually a very unreflective surface, since light focused onto it that is reflected rather than absorbed to be converted into electrical impulses in the optic nerve is light wasted; the human retina only reflects particularly strong and intensive light, which is why people's eyes appear red in certain flash photography)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>we would be unable to see shadows</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bWe don't really &quot;see&quot; shadows; as patches of darkness, a shadow is merely how our brains interpret spots where light input to our retinas is reduced or absent.<br /> <br /> \u200bThat aspect doesn't really have anything to do with whether or not eyes are reflective, they're all about how our perception depends on light being refracted onto out retinas.<br /> <br /> \u200bThat being said, the statement that one cannot get a reflection of a shadow... well, it's technically accurate in the sense that a shadow, as an absence of light, is not casting a reflection in its own right, but shadows can still be perceived in reflective surfaces because everything else is still emitting or reflecting light onto those surfaces, meaning that the shadow is apparent by the absence of light. <br /> <br /> \u200bSure, reflections don't cast shadows, but objects with reflective surfaces still can, and Szoreny is not a personified reflection, he's a forest of mirror-surfaced trees.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-25T04:29:59-07:00","id":1221985,"title":"","content":"Szorney X Isidoros 4lyfe. <br /> <br /> Actually come to think of it, I don't think I've ever seen Jen draw Isidoros.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-25T05:05:22-07:00","id":1221990,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1221728-szoreny-x-the-ebon-dragon-to-ship-or-not-to-ship?p=1221985#post1221985\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Szorney X Isidoros 4lyfe. <br /> <br /> Actually come to think of it, I don't think I've ever seen Jen draw Isidoros.</div> </div> </div> </div>Isator Levi already posted one thread where Jen drew all the named Yozis, save one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-25T10:36:37-07:00","id":1222076,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1221728-szoreny-x-the-ebon-dragon-to-ship-or-not-to-ship?p=1221978#post1221978\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I call foul on this one; the human eye only <i>works</i> because it reflects light. If it were impossible to &quot;get a reflection of a shadow,&quot; <i>we would be unable to see shadows</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>that's not how shadows work...<br /> <br /> a shadow is the absence of light - a silhoute around you where light is not reflected","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-25T22:08:15-07:00","id":1222167,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1221728-szoreny-x-the-ebon-dragon-to-ship-or-not-to-ship?p=1221985#post1221985\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Szorney X Isidoros 4lyfe.<br /> <br /> Actually come to think of it, I don't think I've ever seen Jen draw Isidoros.</div> </div> </div> </div>Mostly because I don't have any feeling whatsoever toward that ship, I can't think of any reasons for those 2 to be together aside from canon mentioning them being together.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>webkilla</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1221728-szoreny-x-the-ebon-dragon-to-ship-or-not-to-ship?p=1221966#post1221966\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would argue that Szory and ED is more of an anti-ship<br /> <br /> A reflection needs light to work<br /> <br /> A shadow also needs light to work<br /> <br /> but you cannot get a reflection of a shadow - and a reflection does not cast a shadow<br /> <br /> the two probably don't like each other that way around, perhaps they see each other as rivals</div> </div> </div> </div>This is ship land webkilla, you are still being bound too much by logic and common sense. If a magic shadow and a magic tree want some sexy time, there will be sexy time, and it will be magical.<br /> <br /> And hopefully, the whole thing about TED needing &quot;light&quot; to opposed will gone the way of the dodo.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-26T06:59:28-07:00","id":1222234,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1221728-szoreny-x-the-ebon-dragon-to-ship-or-not-to-ship?p=1221837#post1221837\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In terms of distinct themes<br /> <br /> Shadows evoke secret truths, buried pasts, and looming dooms.<br /> <br /> Reflections evoke inversions and equal balance, as well as distortion and gateways.<br /> <br /> Notably Black Mirror Shintai\u2019s effects from 2E will be a Szoreny flavored charm in 3E.</div> </div> </div> </div>Agreed.<br /> <br /> Szoreny loves you, and hates you. He wants prove he's better than you by becoming a better you and beating you at your own game. He wants to replace you. He's envy personified and mixed with an inferiority/superiority complex. His relationship with Isidoros is a futile struggle to out-Isidoros Isidoros, and Isidoros finds the imitation flattering and the challenge unthreatening.<br /> <br /> When Szoreny becomes a duplicate of you, the duplicate will love your lovers and hate your enemies as you do, but it will hate you fiercely and do its best to replace you without anyone ever knowing, all while showing you how much better it is than you and trying to convince you to surrender and willingly disappear into the nothingness of the forest of Szoreny's reflections.<br /> <br /> The Ebon Dragon doesn't want to become you. He wants to help you. There's an entire side of yourself that you're ignoring and suppressing, and the Shadow of All Things may think it is the most beautiful part of you. Especially if the thing you are ignoring is your own mortality.<br /> <br /> The Ebon Dragon's themes remind me of Persona 3 and Persona 4.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-27T06:11:46-07:00","id":1222390,"title":"","content":"I don't get it. Isn't Szoreny an upside down silver forest?<br /> <br /> Oh right, you are referring to Big E getting &quot;lost&quot; in Szoreny's... shrubery, aren't you Jen?<br /> <br /> <br /> This was bizarre. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1131-hyper-prime","name":"Hyper Prime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1131_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-27T08:28:18-07:00","id":1222429,"title":"","content":"Ah.<br /> <br /> Szoreny mimics and apes, but he only reflects the surface. What you see is what you get. He's not interested in changing you, just replacing you as The Same But Better.<br /> <br /> The Ebon Dragon ignores the surface. He doesn't mimic or ape anything or anyone; a shadow is always a shadow. He looks deeper, into the darkest places of your heart; the places you ignore and conceal from yourself. Your fears and your conflicted and constrained desires.<br /> <br /> These two Yozi wouldn't get along. Szoreny is absolutely obsessed with outer appearances and violently opposed to inner reflection; to mimic the Ebon Dragon would mean looking inside of himself.<br /> <br /> Also, trying to prove himself a better Ebon Dragon than the Ebon Dragon isn't worth the torture of looking inside other people to better understand them for the sake of improving them for their own sakes. Szoreny is the principle of antagonism and opposition; to help someone else altruistically goes against his nature.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-03T16:01:30-07:00","id":1224468,"title":"","content":"Hm, so one might say such a ship is doomed?<br /> <br /> ...Thereby making TED pursue it all the more fervently? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-03T18:21:30-07:00","id":1224505,"title":"","content":"Oh, the Ebon Dragon probably pursues Szroreny every once in a while, trying to get the Silver Forest to be more honest with himself, but it always results in a fight because that drives Szoreny up the wall.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}